[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11100.71, "timestamp": "03:05:00", "text": "像这样跨越山峰。这是我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11102.11, "timestamp": "03:05:02", "text": "梦境"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11106.07, "timestamp": "03:05:06", "text": "跑酷。我的天哪。想象一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11108.79, "timestamp": "03:05:08", "text": "如果有一天我能学会跑酷的话，对吧？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11112.75, "timestamp": "03:05:12", "text": "我非常喜欢。太酷了。那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11116.03, "timestamp": "03:05:16", "text": "跑酷也就那样吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11119.389, "timestamp": "03:05:19", "text": "好的。就像字面上那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11126.23, "timestamp": "03:05:26", "text": "好的。看看他。他跳了起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11128.55, "timestamp": "03:05:28", "text": "山脉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11130.75, "timestamp": "03:05:30", "text": "等等，我好像听到有人鼓掌？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11137.23, "timestamp": "03:05:37", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11140.15, "timestamp": "03:05:40", "text": "不。《消逝的光芒》最主要的特点是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11143.67, "timestamp": "03:05:43", "text": "该系列游戏的精髓在于其庞大的游戏机制。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11145.91, "timestamp": "03:05:45", "text": "公园呼叫之类的。就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11147.55, "timestamp": "03:05:47", "text": "那是我喝的那杯"}]